# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit the filled-in file.
# Secrets are per tenant; the client YAML only stores the variable NAME.

TRADESYS_ROOT=.
TRADESYS_MEMORY_BACKEND=local          # local | chroma
TRADESYS_LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# Second lock on real-money execution. Leave unset for paper trading.
# TRADESYS_ALLOW_LIVE_TRADING=1

# Per-tenant broker credentials (prefix comes from each client's credential_ref)
TRADESYS__TAL_DAHAN__ALPACA__KEY_ID=
TRADESYS__TAL_DAHAN__ALPACA__SECRET_KEY=

TRADESYS__CLIENT_001__ALPACA__KEY_ID=
TRADESYS__CLIENT_001__ALPACA__SECRET_KEY=

# --- Dashboard / portal -----------------------------------------------------
# Required to enable the admin portal tab on the login screen. Unset = admin
# login disabled entirely (fail closed).
# TRADESYS_ADMIN_PASSCODE=

# Required before any client can connect a broker. Encrypts stored API keys at
# rest (Fernet). If unset, the vault REFUSES to store credentials rather than
# writing them in plaintext. Losing this value makes stored keys unrecoverable —
# back it up in a password manager, and rotate it only by having each client
# reconnect their broker.
# TRADESYS_VAULT_KEY=

# Neither value is authentication. One shared secret, no identities, no audit
# trail. Client passwords ARE per-account and PBKDF2-hashed, but the transport is
# still plain Streamlit. Put a real identity proxy in front before this leaves
# localhost.

# --- Earnings data ----------------------------------------------------------
# Optional. With a key set, earnings dates are pulled from Finnhub automatically
# and earnings.yaml is ignored. Free tier at finnhub.io/register is sufficient
# for a watchlist of this size (60 requests/minute).
# Without it, maintain earnings.yaml by hand.
# TRADESYS_FINNHUB_API_KEY=

# Override the hand-maintained calendar path (defaults to <root>/earnings.yaml)
# TRADESYS_EARNINGS_FILE=

# --- Live market data for the demo ------------------------------------------
# One platform-level Alpaca key feeds live prices to every paper/demo tenant.
# Balances stay in our own paper ledger; nothing is sent to a broker. A free
# Alpaca Paper account's keys work here. Unset = synthetic prices.
# TRADESYS_MARKET_DATA__KEY_ID=
# TRADESYS_MARKET_DATA__SECRET_KEY=
# TRADESYS_MARKET_DATA__FEED=iex        # iex (free) | sip (paid, full tape)
